WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:06.700
Up next we're visiting our Vista location,
opened in 2022 when another dispensary

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.280
was preparing to close its doors.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.100
Wellgreens took over this location
and it's been growing ever since.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.260
Vista is also home to our
North County Delivery Hub.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.940
Customers in many North County
communities including Oceanside, San

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.260
Marcos, Encinitas, Del Mar,
Rancho Santa Fe and Carlsbad

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:32.400
can order through the Wellgreens app and
have their delivery routed from Vista

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.380
right to their door.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.220
If you'd rather speak with someone, you
can call the Vista location and place your

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.280
delivery order by phone.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:46.280
Located at 954 South Santa
Fe Avenue right next to Civic

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.040
Center. Come see us, we
would love to help you out.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:54.760
Thank you. As you can see, Vista
has implemented a self-serve model.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.700
Customers enjoy this because they can take
their time and browse the store at their

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:06.160
leisure. Just

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:10.720
like all Wellgreens locations, Vista has
an amazing last chance section where you

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:14.420
can get products up to
40% off on a daily basis.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.820
Come check out our last chance area.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:22.740
Vista also has an amazing selection of
deals on over 20 products on a daily

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.460
basis. The deals rotate
every three months.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:30.580
Come take a look at our Vista location
and see some of the best deals in the

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:31.400
industry.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:37.900
My favorite part

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:43.320
