00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.600
is definitely being able to help people.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:50.520
It's my number one favorite thing to do
here as well as delivering customers their

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:51.580
goodies straight to their door.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.060
There's something really
special about that.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.700
Honestly, man, you guys
always got the best deals.

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:58.920
Always got the fire.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.160
Everything's always good.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.540
I mean, there's nothing
to complain about, man.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:04.760
I come here at least
a couple times a week.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.440
But you know what?

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:08.420
Got to try everything out, man.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.040
There's a lot of options and there's
a lot of new things to try every time.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:16.400
So if you don't find something, the first
time you're going to find something else,

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.880
