of options on stuff to grab.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.940
Always fire, always quality
and always great prices.

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:23.840
Thank you so much for your time.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:25.240
No worries, man.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:30.500
Thanks for taking the time and watching
